<title>INDONESIA: South African President Mandela flies to Thailand.</title>
<headline>South African President Mandela flies to Thailand.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's President Nelson Mandela left Jakarta for Bangkok on Wednesday after a two-day state visit to Indonesia.</p>
<p>Mandela is due to return to South Africa after his visit to Thailand at the end of a trip which included a four-day official stay in London.</p>
</text>
